---
title: Cold Foam
image: https://thegirlonbloor.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Cold-foam-recipe-6-768x1152.jpg
time required: 2 minutes
servings: 2
---

In a #small cup{}, using a #frother{}, mix @heavy cream{3%tbsp} with @milk{2%tbsp} just until combined. 

Add @?flavored syrup{1%tbsp}(~2 Torani pumps) and continuing mixing, moving the frother up and down to create a fluffy yet pourable foam.

> You can simply use ~1/3 cup diary of your choice for simplicity, i.e. oat milk, half-and-half, etc.